{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"text":"Requirements","level":2,"anchor":"Requirements","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS 16.0+","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift 5.9+","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode 16+","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.adyen.com\/issuing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" integration on your backend","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Prerequisites","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Attest"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" entitlement (","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to your app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set to "},{"code":"\"development\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for testing. Use "},{"code":"SessionEnvironment.test","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Card operations work fully, but the provisioning flow is limited."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set to "},{"code":"\"production\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for production. Use "},{"code":"SessionEnvironment.live","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The full provisioning flow requires an App Store or TestFlight build."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TestFlight builds automatically set the App Attest environment to "},{"code":"\"production\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","text":"Embed the Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","text":"Fetch a Session Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Perform a ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" request to the following endpoint:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Environment","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Test","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Live","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Headers:","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Content-Type: application\/json"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body:"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The required ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roles"},{"text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Import the SDK","anchor":"Import-the-SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This gives you access to all public types, including "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"ProvisioningSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not import ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"text":"Implement a Token Provider","anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Device Testing Requirements","anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK requires a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Release build on a physical device","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next Steps","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Next-Steps"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/SessionsProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/OfflineProvisioningGuide"},{"text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSession